# Corpus bytes are pinned by SHA-256 in corpus/MANIFEST.json, so any end-of-line
# normalisation changes the hash and makes the immutability ADR 0010 claims false on a
# fresh clone. A Windows checkout converts LF to CRLF by default: measured, that turned
# b01-pcert-ifc4's pinned e390f9f9... into 331ceb86... and failed CI on every commit while
# every developer working copy stayed green, because a working copy is never re-converted.
*.ifc                  -text
corpus/expected/*.json -text
